      "message": "fix(ui): browser build saves, posts as downloads and greys the file commands it cannot run\n\nIn the wasm build every file dialog answered \"cancelled\" and only logged\nit, so Open, Save, Save As and Post did nothing on screen.\n\n- app: project::save_text and posting::post_setup_unwritten return the\n  bytes the desktop writes (same collect, gate and engine run); save and\n  post_setup now call them, so the two cannot drift.\n- ui: browser_files hands the bytes to the browser as a download (Blob,\n  object URL, anchor click through eframe::web_sys; Save As asks the name\n  with window.prompt). Save, Save As, the unsaved prompt's Save and Post\n  download in the browser.\n- ui: browser_files::refusal names every command the browser cannot run\n  yet (open pickers, recent files, folders, the four exports); State::run\n  refuses them on the status line, ribbon cells and page buttons are\n  greyed with the reason as their tip.\n\nOpen paths stay owed to PR #1314; the exports to #1437.\n\nRefs #1431\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
